<span data-v-89da4b31> ::: </span></a></div></div><section class="about" data-aos="fade-up" data-v-1dbc2d82 data-v-f84cf6d3><div class="about-container" data-v-f84cf6d3><div class="about-content" data-v-f84cf6d3><h2 class="about-title" data-v-f84cf6d3>認識義守</h2><div class="zh-TW intro" data-v-f84cf6d3><p class="desc" data-v-f84cf6d3>義守大學為重視人文、科技、醫學並培育多元人才的國際化綜合大學，對焦跨領域人才培育教學模式之創新，並深耕延續既有之發展特色、創新教學與產研能量，引導跨領域、跨疆域學習，發揮綜合型大學豐富的跨學科領域優勢。</p><a href="/about" class="more" title="了解更多-認識義守" data-v-f84cf6d3>了解更多</a><div class="shape-svg" data-v-f84cf6d3><img src="/_nuxt/shape_svg.89f82db3.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" data-v-f84cf6d3></div></div><div class="img" data-v-f84cf6d3><img src="https://www.isu.edu.tw/storage/images/ST1wvPgA23DKLkJplqcLOgFWb87r4YlSDKo5bZDr.jpg" alt="" data-v-f84cf6d3></div><div class="text-container" data-v-f84cf6d3><div class="text" data-v-f84cf6d3>ISU A Place Where Dreams Come True！</div></div></div></div></section><section class="field" data-aos="fade-up" style="overflow:hidden;" data-v-1dbc2d82 data-v-cac4622f><div class="field-container" data-v-cac4622f><div class="field-content" data-v-cac4622f><h2 class="field-title" data-v-cac4622f>特色場域 跨域創新</h2><div class="field1" data-v-cac4622f><div class="field-list-1" data-v-cac4622f><div class="deco1" data-rellax-speed="0.2" data-v-cac4622f><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="" data-v-cac4622f></div><!--[--><div class="field-item" data-v-cac4622f><a href="/study" class="link" title="跨域學習" data-v-cac4622f><div class="img" data-v-cac4622f><img src="https://www.isu.edu.tw/storage/images/WXgnTFXpktW3m0dK0G1aqKFxyEM69qVDfva5eSch.jpg" alt data-v-cac4622f></div><div class="body" data-v-cac4622f><p class="title" data-v-cac4622f>跨域學習</p><span class="desc" data-v-cac4622f>智慧科技 創新學習</span></div></a></div><div class="field-item" data-v-cac4622f><a href="/room" class="link" title="學習空間" data-v-cac4622f><div class="img" data-v-cac4622f><img src="https://www.isu.edu.tw/storage/images/lmgT0yZXshejCfm1i8K67ZLuOuLLxD1Fse3FZQCe.jpg" alt data-v-cac4622f></div><div class="body" data-v-cac4622f><p class="title" data-v-cac4622f>學習空間</p><span class="desc" data-v-cac4622f>多元圖書 特色教室</span></div></a></div><div class="field-item" data-v-cac4622f><a href="https://oica.isu.edu.tw/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_self" class="link" title="國際鏈結" data-v-cac4622f><div class="img" data-v-cac4622f><img src="https://www.isu.edu.tw/storage/images/PFdpqzhhOtdyQQAkeyHicWdh8zvCxuAvQRI2HcVd.jpg" alt data-v-cac4622f></div><div class="body" data-v-cac4622f><p class="title" data-v-cac4622f>國際鏈結</p><span class="desc" data-v-cac4622f>全英涵養 接軌國際</span></div></a></div><div class="field-item" data-v-cac4622f><a href="/field" class="link" title="特色場域" data-v-cac4622f><div class="img" data-v-cac4622f><img src="https://www.isu.edu.tw/storage/images/p62xgA5aqPCUibkoiOxg9Kit6ChJ0XrjqQvszMh4.jpg" alt data-v-cac4622f></div><div class="body" data-v-cac4622f><p class="title" data-v-cac4622f>特色場域</p><span class="desc" data-v-cac4622f>頂尖設備 特色學習</span></div></a></div><!--]--><div class="deco2" data-rellax-speed="-0.5" data-v-cac4622f><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="" data-v-cac4622f></div></div><div class="deco" data-v-cac4622f></div></div><div class="field2" data-v-cac4622f><div class="field-list-2" data-v-cac4622f><!--[--><div class="field-item" data-v-cac4622f><div class="head" data-v-cac4622f><div class="img" data-v-cac4622f><img src="https://www.isu.edu.tw/storage/images/tBFW40151wBuGTuwbV1iHH5szlF8g8hAtVt4m1J0.png" alt="" data-v-cac4622f></div></div><div class="body" data-v-cac4622f><p class="title" data-v-cac4622f>跨域創新兼具<br />產學服務能力之<br />國際化綜合型大學</p><!----></div></div><div class="field-item" data-v-cac4622f><div class="head" data-v-cac4622f><div class="img" data-v-cac4622f><img src="https://www.isu.edu.tw/storage/images/z3fNGExFNtZlercPaDMF43RUjeVGPp6KrLtHjLen.png" alt="" data-v-cac4622f></div></div><div class="body" data-v-cac4622f><p class="title" data-v-cac4622f>一流的學習​環境<br />與​教學資源</p><span class="desc" data-v-cac4622f>義守大學擁有尖端的教學設備，本校擴充各系所實驗<br />
室，並因應時代潮流建置特色學習場域，以滿足跨領<br />
域與數位學習需求。</span></div></div><!--]--></div></div></div></div></section><section style="" class="news" data-aos="fade-up" data-v-1dbc2d82 data-v-5fa9005d><div class="news-container" data-v-5fa9005d><h2 class="zh-TW section-title" data-v-5fa9005d>義大新聞 <a href="/news" class="news-link" title="到亮點新聞" aria-label="到亮點新聞" data-v-5fa9005d><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-hidden="true" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" viewbox="0 0 24 24" class="iconify iconify--line-md" data-v-5fa9005d><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-dasharray="48" stroke-dashoffset="48" d="M11 5h-6v14h14v-6"><animate fill="freeze" attributeName="stroke-dashoffset" dur="0.6s" values="48;0"></animate></path><path stroke-dasharray="12" stroke-dashoffset="12" d="M13 11l7 -7"><animate fill="freeze" attributeName="stroke-dashoffset" begin="0.6s" dur="0.2s" values="12;0"></animate></path><path stroke-dasharray="8" stroke-dashoffset="8" d="M21 3h-6M21 3v6"><animate fill="freeze" attributeName="stroke-dashoffset" begin="0.8s" dur="0.2s" values="8;0"></animate></path></g></svg></a><span data-v-5fa9005d>校園消息 ， 一手掌握</span></h2><div class="news-content" data-v-5fa9005d><div class="news-swiper-container" data-v-5fa9005d><div class="bg-img" aria-hidden="true" data-v-5fa9005d><img src="/_nuxt/news-bg.76caa93f.jpg" alt="" data-v-5fa9005d></div><div class="swiper news-swiper" data-v-5fa9005d><!--[--><!--]--><div class="swiper-wrapper"><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><div class="swiper-slide news-slide" data-v-5fa9005d><!--[--><div class="slide-item" data-v-5fa9005d><div class="img" data-v-5fa9005d><img src="https://www.isu.edu.tw/storage/images/thumb_8RniYiwFd9rLg8RnuBMVdQbmLJlCgvjEYf0wi9pF.webp" alt data-v-5fa9005d></div><div class="body" data-v-5fa9005d><time data-v-5fa9005d>2026-10-29</time><p class="title" data-v-5fa9005d>義守大學國際文化義術節登場　多國文化交融、歌聲串起跨國友誼</p><a href="/news/kDYAmi9JQHD7" class="li