hPYrbWb1735u9X9bC.jpg","https://www.isu.edu.tw/storage/images/thumb_d2sA1oBvlFcKAs2pfYUUfgohPYrbWb1735u9X9bC.webp","AI創作懷舊歌曲翻轉銀髮生活！義守大學「燕巢樂齡實驗室」展現USR創新成果-TsHaL2OUFvpq",{"category":59,"title":72,"description":5,"post_date":73,"url":5,"target":37,"image_path":74,"thumb_path":75,"page_link":76},"義守大學歡慶創校36周年　深化AI教育布局迎向高教新時代","2026-10-21","https://www.isu.edu.tw/storage/images/mtVmv0iqHULgxxxoSnA6zhfKu9sWvVUsmZzJ7e99.jpg","https://www.isu.edu.tw/storage/images/thumb_mtVmv0iqHULgxxxoSnA6zhfKu9sWvVUsmZzJ7e99.webp","義守大學歡慶創校36周年　深化AI教育布局迎向高教新時代-05z4apeysrSf",{"category":59,"title":78,"description":5,"post_date":79,"url":5,"target":37,"image_path":80,"thumb_path":81,"page_link":82},"義守大學推動行政AI創新應用　從工作現場打造智慧校園新模式","2026-10-19","https://www.isu.edu.tw/storage/images/s69IyoSgqH57hLZG2aluY9XjsaUyKXZBIM9Q9YjH.jpg","https://www.isu.edu.tw/storage/images/thumb_s69IyoSgqH57hLZG2aluY9XjsaUyKXZBIM9Q9YjH.webp","義守大學推動行政AI創新應用　從工作現場打造智慧校園新模式-H6nm9GtnT0rN",{"category":59,"title":84,"description":5,"post_date":85,"url":5,"target":37,"image_path":86,"thumb_path":87,"page_link":88},"工程實力獲全國肯定　義守大學許万峻獲優秀工程學生獎學金","2026-10-15","https://www.isu.edu.tw/storage/images/6uW8GzsrV6V2cuOd6M0KekyW7zbzhap6mzDefs6f.jpg","https://www.isu.edu.tw/storage/images/thumb_6uW8GzsrV6V2cuOd6M0KekyW7zbzhap6mzDefs6f.webp","工程實力獲全國肯定　義守大學許万峻獲優秀工程學生獎學金-wmC7Am3wfJxQ",{"data":90,"status":24,"message":5},[91,99,122,133,137],{"type":92,"title":93,"content":5,"blocks":94},1,"認識義守",[95],{"title":93,"content":96,"ext":34,"file_path":97,"video_url":5,"url":98,"target":37},"義守大學為重視人文、科技、醫學並培育多元人才的國際化綜合大學，對焦跨領域人才培育教學模式之創新，並深耕延續既有之發展特色、創新教學與產研能量，引導跨領域、跨疆域學習，發揮綜合型大學豐富的跨學科領域優勢。","https://www.isu.edu.tw/storage/images/ST1wvPgA23DKLkJplqcLOgFWb87r4YlSDKo5bZDr.jpg","/about",{"type":92,"title":100,"content":5,"blocks":101},"特色場域 跨域創新",[102,107,112,117],{"title":103,"content":104,"ext":34,"file_path":105,"video_url":5,"url":106,"target":37},"跨域學習","智慧科技 創新學習","https://www.isu.edu.tw/storage/images/WXgnTFXpktW3m0dK0G1aqKFxyEM69qVDfva5eSch.jpg","/study",{"title":108,"content":109,"ext":34,"file_path":110,"video_url":5,"url":111,"target":37},"學習空間","多元圖書 特色教室","https://www.isu.edu.tw/storage/images/lmgT0yZXshejCfm1i8K67ZLuOuLLxD1Fse3FZQCe.jpg","/room",{"title":113,"content":114,"ext":34,"file_path":115,"video_url":5,"url":116,"target":37},"國際鏈結","全英涵養 接軌國際","https://www.isu.edu.tw/storage/images/PFdpqzhhOtdyQQAkeyHicWdh8zvCxuAvQRI2HcVd.jpg","https://oica.isu.edu.tw/",{"title":118,"content":119,"ext":34,"file_path":120,"video_url":5,"url":121,"target":37},"特色場域","頂尖設備 特色學習","https://www.isu.edu.tw/storage/images/p62xgA5aqPCUibkoiOxg9Kit6ChJ0XrjqQvszMh4.jpg","/field",{"type":92,"title":123,"content":5,"blocks":124},"特色場域 跨域創新2",[125,129],{"title":126,"content":15,"ext":127,"file_path":128,"video_url":5,"url":5,"target":37},"跨域創新兼具\u003Cbr/>產學服務能力之\u003Cbr/>國際化綜合型大學","png","https://www.isu.edu.tw/storage/images/tBFW40151wBuGTuwbV1iHH5szlF8g8hAtVt4m1J0.png",{"title":130,"content":131,"ext":127,"file_path":132,"video_url":5,"url":5,"target":37},"一流的學習​環境\u003Cbr/>與​教學資源","義守大學擁有尖端的教學設備，本校擴充各系所實驗\u003Cbr />\r\n室，並因應時代潮流建置特色學習場域，以滿足跨領\u003Cbr />\r\n域與數位學習需求。","https://www.isu.edu.tw/storage/images/z3fNGExFNtZlercPaDMF43RUjeVGPp6KrLtHjLen.png",{"type":92,"title":134,"content":135,"blocks":136},"義大新聞","校園消息 ， 一手掌握",[],{"type":92,"title":138,"content":5,"blocks":139},"義守生活大小事",[140],{"title":138,"content":141,"ext":34,"file_path":142,"video_url":5,"url":143,"target":37},"義守大學擁有得天獨厚的觀音山自然風光，致力營造安全舒適的學習環境，以滿足學生在食、衣、住、行、育、樂各方面的生活需求，並設有豐富獎助學金，讓學生安心求學。","https://www.isu.edu.tw/storage/images/kedNOS2Byft0iQlVen1e99xOoT9lqdAEDDtYfmq6.jpg","/live",{"data":145,"status":24,"message":5},[146,182,209],{"name":147,"sub":148,"url":5,"target":37,"page_link":15,"image_path":15,"thumb_path":15},"公開資訊",[149,153,157,161,165,169,173,177],{"name":150,"sub":151,"url":152,"target":37,"page_link":15,"image_path":15,"thumb_path":15},"行事曆",[],"/calendar",{"name":154,"sub":155,"url":156,"target":37,"page_link":15,"image_path":15,"thu